# Rom and Leeta, Unlikely Pair: "each turn" counts any turn (CR 603.2). On Bot2's turn 2 Bot1 draws nothing in a draw
# step, so its first Opt is its first card of that turn and makes nothing, and its second Opt is the second card: the
# trigger fires and two tapped Treasure tokens arrive as it resolves (CR 111.10a), still on Bot2's turn.
